'''{{PAGENAME}}''' is a [[Story chapters|story chapter]] in ''[[Escape from Tarkov]]''.

==Description==
{{quote|I came across a strange note on a TerraGroup sheet. It mentions the will of The Unheard and some fuel needed for "purification". TerraGroup's definitely involved in this, and I should gather more information about The Unheard.}}

==Requirements==
Pick up and read [[Note with ramblings about the Purification]] from one of the following locations:
* In the surveillance room inside the TerraGroup security post building on [[Streets of Tarkov]]
<li style="display: inline-block;"><gallery widths="300" heights="169" mode="packed">
File:BeyondMeat2.png|Building location marked on map
File:TerraGroup security post Building.png|The building entrance
File:TerraGroup security armory Way 1.png|Way to the surveillance room 1
File:TerraGroup security armory Way 2.png|Way to the surveillance room 2
File:The Unheard Activation Location 1.png|The note on the desk
</gallery></li>
* In the TerraGroup office on [[Streets of Tarkov]]
<li style="display: inline-block;"><gallery widths="300" heights="169" mode="packed">
File:BeyondMeat2.png|Office location marked on map
File:Beyond the Red Meat 2 31.png|Way to the office
File:The Unheard Activation Location 2.png|The note on a cabinet next to the meeting room door
</gallery></li>
* In office no. 4 on the second floor of the TerraGroup main building on [[Ground Zero|Ground Zero (Level 21+)]]. [[TerraGroup science office key]] required.
<li style="display: inline-block;"><gallery widths="300" heights="169" mode="packed">
