</gallery></li>

==Objectives==
* [[Note with ramblings about the Purification|Learn more]] about The Unheard
* Learn more about [[Document on changes in enterprise interactions|TerraGroup's activities]]
* Learn more about [[Cargo transport fax|the "fuel"]] mentioned in the note
* Find more [[Transport log with notes|information]] about the special catalyst shipment
* Locate Rzhevsky's service vehicle and obtain his [[Hard drive from Rzhevsky's car|personal belongings]]
* Retrieve the data from the [[Hard drive from Rzhevsky's car|hard drive in Rzhevsky's car]]
* Read the [[Hard drive printout|transcript]] of Rzhevsky's conversation
* Locate and obtain the [[Fuel catalyst test report|documents]] on the Blue Ice fuel catalyst research
* Find as much [[Burnt document|information]] as possible about the plans of The Unheard
* Learn more about [[A.P. meeting audio tape Part 1|A.P.'s activities]]
* Learn more about [[A.P. meeting audio tape Part 2|A.P.'s role]]
* Search for any mention of A.P. in [[The Lab]]
* Locate A.P.'s room in the Health Resort
** (''Optional'') [[Guard post note|Find out]] which room A.P. was assigned to
* Obtain A.P.'s [[TerraGroup corporate apartment key|personal belongings]]
* Obtain A.P.'s [[Sliderkey flash drive marked with A.P.|data storage device]]
* Decrypt the [[Sliderkey flash drive marked with A.P.|flash drive]] from A.P.'s room
* Ask [[Mechanic]] for help
* Hand over 5,000,000 [[Roubles]] to [[Mechanic]]
* Hand over the [[Decrypted Sliderkey flash drive marked with A.P.|A.P. flash drive]] to [[Mechanic]]
* Wait for the news from Elektronik
* Integrate the tech files from [[Decrypted Sliderkey flash drive marked with A.P.|A.P.'s flash drive]] into a [[Reprogrammed keycard for A.P.'s apartment lock (Green)|TerraGroup keycard]]
* Access [[TerraGroup corporate apartment key|A.P.'s corporate apartment]]
* Investigate [[TerraGroup corporate apartment key|A.P.'s apartment]]
* Access the [[Reprogrammed keycard for A.P.'s apartment lock (Green)|hidden room]] in A.P.'s apartment
* Study the [[Order from TerraGroup Worldwide headquarters|TerraGroup documentation]] in A.P.'s office
* [[Copy of report for TG Worldwide|Study]] the role of the Blue Ice catalyst in The Unheard's protocol
* Learn more about [[Document mentioning a protocol|The Unheard's protocol]]
* [[Document mentioning the Warden|Figure out]] how The Unheard are connected to Tarkov

